gation job runs only when the repo VARIABLE\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-16-# RELEASE_TRAIN_ARMED is \"true\" (a variable, not a secret, so it can gate a job-level `if:`\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:17:# directly — no guard-step dance needed). Until the operator sets it, a published release runs\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-18-# readiness (useful signal) and skips propagation. The mirror + deploy legs additionally keep\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:19:# their own inert-until-armed guards (MIRROR_PUSH_TOKEN, RAILWAY_TOKEN), so arming the train\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:20:# without arming those legs still no-ops them green. Leg 1 (registry publish) deliberately does\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:21:# NOT no-op: with R2 keys unset it fails loud (a silent green \"publish\" would mark a release\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-22-# done while buyers 404 on the tarballs).\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-23-#\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:24:# The retired per-push triggers: publish.yml (dry-run on every main push) and mirror-sync.yml\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-25-# (snapshot per main push) no longer fire on push — the train is their scheduler now; both keep\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:26:# workflow_dispatch as the manual lever.\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-27-on:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:28:  release:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:29:    types: [published]\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-30-\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:31:permissions:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-32-  contents: read\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-33-\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-34-concurrency:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-35-  group: release-train\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-36-  cancel-in-progress: false\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-37-\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-38-jobs:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-39-  readiness:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-40-    runs-on: ${{ vars.CI_RUNNER_LINUX || 'ubuntu-latest' }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-41-    timeout-minutes: 20\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:42:    permissions:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-43-      contents: read\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-44-      checks: read # readiness check 1 reads the check-runs API on the release SHA\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-45-      pull-requests: read # `bun run sot` tracker-vs-reality reads PR states via `gh pr view`\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-46-    steps:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:47:      - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-48-        with:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-49-          fetch-depth: 0\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-50-      - uses: oven-sh/setup-bun@0c5077e51419868618aeaa5fe8019c62421857d6 # v2.2.0\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-51-        with:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-52-          bun-version: \"1.4.2\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-53-      - run: bun install --frozen-lockfile\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-54-      - name: release readiness (R3)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-55-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:56:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:57:          # env-indirect, never inlined in run: — a tag name may legally contain `$();|&`\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:58:          # (github.sha is hex-safe but rides along for consistency).\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:59:          RELEASE_TAG: ${{ github.event.release.tag_name }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:60:          RELEASE_SHA: ${{ github.sha }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-61-        run: |\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-62-          bun scripts/release-readiness.ts \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:63:            --tag \"$RELEASE_TAG\" \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-64-            --sha \"$RELEASE_SHA\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-65-\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-66-  propagate:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-67-    needs: readiness\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-68-    # Dormant until the operator sets the RELEASE_TRAIN_ARMED repo variable to \"true\" (ADR-0318:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-69-    # the train ships dormant; W3 arming is an operator act). Skipped-when-unarmed keeps the\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-70-    # workflow green.\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-71-    if: vars.RELEASE_TRAIN_ARMED == 'true'\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-72-    runs-on: ${{ vars.CI_RUNNER_LINUX || 'ubuntu-latest' }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-73-    timeout-minutes: 90\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-74-    environment: release # ADR-0327 rider 2 (definition-first; free-plan protection rules can't enforce yet)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:75:    permissions:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-76-      contents: read\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:77:      actions: write # dispatch same-repo workflows (publish.yml, deploy-worker.yml, mirror-sync.yml, deploy-railway.yml)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-78-    steps:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:79:      - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-80-      # Dispatch a workflow and block until its run concludes; fail the train on a red leg.\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-81-      # `gh workflow run` returns no run id, so poll for the newest run created after dispatch\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-82-      # (concurrency: single-operator repo + per-workflow concurrency groups make this safe).\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-83-      - name: leg helper\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-84-        run: |\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-85-          cat > /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh <<'EOF'\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-86-          #!/usr/bin/env bash\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-87-          set -euo pipefail\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-88-          repo=\"$1\"; workflow=\"$2\"; shift 2\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-89-          before=\"$(date -u '+%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ')\"\n--\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-93-            sleep 10\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-94-            run_id=\"$(gh run list -R \"$repo\" --workflow \"$workflow\" --created \">$before\" \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-95-              --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq '.[0].databaseId // empty')\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-96-            [ -n \"$run_id\" ] && break\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-97-          done\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-98-          if [ -z \"$run_id\" ]; then echo \"::error::$repo/$workflow: dispatched run never appeared\"; exit 1; fi\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-99-          echo \"watching $repo/$workflow run $run_id\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-100-          gh run watch \"$run_id\" -R \"$repo\" --exit-status --interval 30\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-101-          EOF\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-102-          chmod +x /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:103:      - name: leg 1 — registry publish (verify + upload EXACTLY the tagged bytes, LIVE)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-104-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:105:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:106:          RELEASE_TAG: ${{ github.event.release.tag_name }} # env-indirect, never inlined in run:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-107-        run: |\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:108:          /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh \"${{ github.repository }}\" publish.yml \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:109:            -f dry_run=false -f tag=\"$RELEASE_TAG\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-110-      # Leg 1 uploaded the tarball BYTES; this makes them RESOLVABLE. deploy-entry.ts inlines\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-111-      # registry/index.json into the Worker bundle at build time, so without this leg the edge keeps\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-112-      # serving its previously-baked catalog and `bun add @caisson/<pkg>` returns the last release —\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-113-      # exactly what happened on v2026.07.30, where a fully green train left the site advertising an\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-114-      # entry point the registry could not resolve. Numbered 1b, not 5, because the order is\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-115-      # load-bearing: after the bytes exist (leg 1), before the site advertises them (leg 4).\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:116:      - name: leg 1b — registry Worker deploy (bake the tagged index onto the live edge)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-117-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:118:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:119:          RELEASE_TAG: ${{ github.event.release.tag_name }} # env-indirect, never inlined in run:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-120-        run: |\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-121-          /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh \"${{ github.repository }}\" deploy-worker.yml \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-122-            -f ref=\"$RELEASE_TAG\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:123:      - name: leg 2 — public mirror sync (exported at the release tag)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-124-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:125:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:126:          RELEASE_TAG: ${{ github.event.release.tag_name }} # env-indirect, never inlined in run:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-127-        run: |\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-128-          /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh \"${{ github.repository }}\" mirror-sync.yml \\\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-129-            -f ref=\"$RELEASE_TAG\"\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:130:      - name: leg 3 — mirror npm publish (caisson-sh/caisson-oss)\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:131:        # Pre-launch train rides skip the public npm leg (ADR-0329, amends 0325): MIRROR_PUSH_TOKEN\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-132-        # stopped being an inert-guard when mirror-sync armed it 2026-07-10, so this leg needs its\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-133-        # own arming variable. Set RELEASE_NPM_MIRROR_ARMED=true at the ADR-0318 W3 public flip.\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-134-        if: vars.RELEASE_NPM_MIRROR_ARMED == 'true'\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-135-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:136:          # MIRROR_PUSH_TOKEN is the fine-grained PAT on caisson-sh/caisson-oss (contents +\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-137-          # actions/workflows rw) — the same credential mirror-sync pushes with.\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:138:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.MIRROR_PUSH_TOKEN }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:139:        run: /tmp/dispatch-and-wait.sh caisson-sh/caisson-oss publish.yml -f confirm=publish\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-140-      - name: leg 4 — site redeploy\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-141-        env:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:142:          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:143:          RELEASE_TAG: ${{ github.event.release.tag_name }} # env-indirect, never inlined in run:\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-144-        # require_armed=true: an unarmed deploy leg must FAIL the train, not skip green. Found\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml-145-        # 2026-07-28 during v2026.07.27.1 — the train reported all legs green while the site kept\n.github/workflows/release-train.yml:146:        # serving the previous image, because RAILWAY